{% extends "_base_line.j2" %}
{% block extra_rules %}
- This line is inside an ASCII / decision-tree diagram fence.
- Preserve EVERY structural character exactly: box-drawing (`│├└─┌┐┘┤┬┴┼`),
  ASCII tree markers (`|--`, `+--`), arrows (`→`, `->`), pipes, and spaces.
- Preserve indentation (leading spaces) exactly — nesting is meaning.
- Translate only the human-readable words/labels. Do not reflow into a paragraph.
- Do not add or remove tree branches.
{% endblock %}
{% block examples %}
  in   10\t├── 数据是否可以发送到外部 API?
  out  10\t├── Can data be sent to an external API?
  in   11\t│   ├── 否（合规/安全要求内部部署）
  out  11\t│   ├── No (compliance/security requires internal deployment)
  in   12\t选型决策起点
  out  12\tSelection decision starting point
  in   13\t                    [问题: 集群网络不通]
  out  13\t                    [Problem: Cluster network unreachable]
  in   14\t    [方向A: CNI]
  out  14\t    [Direction A: CNI]
  in   15\t    [评分: 0.7]
  out  15\t    [Score: 0.7]
  in   16\t   ❌ get_all_info（返回所有信息，LLM 难以选择）
  out  16\t   ❌ get_all_info (returns all information; LLM cannot choose easily)
{% endblock %}
